rent; border-left: 6px solid #f4f4f4; border-bottom: 2px solid transparent; transform: translateX(16px) translateY(-4px) rotate(30deg)\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"margin-left: auto;\">\n<div style=\" width: 0px; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-right: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(16px);\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; flex-grow: 0; height: 12px; width: 16px; transform: translateY(-4px);\"></div>\n<div style=\" width: 0; height: 0; border-top: 8px solid #F4F4F4; border-left: 8px solid transparent; transform: translateY(-4px) translateX(8px);\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; margin-bottom: 6px; width: 224px;\"></div>\n<div style=\" background-color: #F4F4F4; border-radius: 4px; flex-grow: 0; height: 14px; width: 144px;\"></div>\n</div>\n<p></a></div>\n</blockquote>\n<p><script async src=\"//platform.instagram.com/en_US/embeds.js\"></script></p>\n<p>いつもの河川敷がどのような会場に変わるのか楽しみですね。初夏の自然を満喫しながら普段なかなかできない貴重な体験をしに行きましょう。</p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-53458\" src=\"https://kakogawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/22/2025/04/IMG_3244_Original.jpeg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1280\" height=\"960\" srcset=\"https://kakogawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/22/2025/04/IMG_3244_Original.jpeg 1280w, https://kakogawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/22/2025/04/IMG_3244_Original-768x576.jpeg 768w, https://kakogawa.goguynet.jp/wp-content/uploads/sites/22/2025/04/IMG_3244_Original-1024x767.jpeg 1024w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #ff0000;font-size: 1.143em\"><strong>一般社団法人縁日地域振興協会様、情報提供ありがとうございます！</strong></span></p>\n<p>加古川河川敷どうぶつの森広場</p>\n<div class=\"googlemaps\">\n\t\t\t\t<iframe loading=\"lazy\" width=\"600\" height=\"450\" framebord